    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's helpful. Can you expand on what happens to the root system during these deficiency periods? I want to be able to explain the physiological signs the client might see in the vines if the pH gets too high and the iron/manganese uptake drops off.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
