      "role": "user",
      "content": "Could you probably go a bit deeper into the soil chemistry side? Specifically, what's the actual chemical mechanism that causes those micronutrients to precipitate out of the soil solution as the pH climbs? I need to make sure the explanation is rigorous enough for a professional report.",
